---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---
<AdminLayout title="Overview"><h1>Welcome to your content desk</h1><p>Prepare bilingual content, keep drafts private, and publish only when both language versions are approved.</p><section class="metrics"><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon">▤</span><p>Catalogue titles</p><strong>—</strong><small>Titles will appear here once added.</small></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon gold">✦</span><p>News drafts</p><strong>—</strong><small>Keep articles in draft until approved.</small></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-icon green">✓</span><p>Content health</p><strong>Ready</strong><small>Use bilingual fields before publishing.</small></article></section><section class="quick card"><div><p class="section-kicker">Start here</p><h2>Build the launch catalogue</h2><p>Your public catalogue is empty. Add bilingual title information first, then attach approved covers and publish after review.</p></div><a class="button" href="/admin/catalogue/">Open catalogue <span>→</span></a></section><section class="workflow card"><h2>Publishing workflow</h2><ol><li><b>01</b><span><strong>Draft</strong><small>Write both English and French versions.</small></span></li><li><b>02</b><span><strong>Review</strong><small>Confirm copy, cover, level, and curriculum alignment.</small></span></li><li><b>03</b><span><strong>Publish</strong><small>Make approved content visible to visitors.</small></span></li></ol></section></AdminLayout>
<style>.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.metric-card{min-height:190px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #3c29310a}.metric-card p{margin:17px 0 2px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.metric-card strong{display:block;font:700 32px/1 Poppins,system-ui;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.04em}.metric-card small{display:block;margin-top:11px;color:var(--muted)}.metric-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1e2e7;color:var(--wine);font-weight:900}.metric-icon.gold{background:#f8efdd;color:#a97720}.metric-icon.green{background:#e5f3ec;color:var(--green)}.quick{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff,#fff8ed)}.quick p{max-width:620px;color:var(--muted)}.quick .button{white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}.quick .button span{margin-left:8px}.section-kicker{margin:0!important;color:var(--wine)!important;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.workflow ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);list-style:none;margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;gap:16px}.workflow li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}.workflow b{color:var(--gold);font:800 18px Poppins,system-ui}.workflow strong,.workflow small{display:block}.workflow small{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.metrics,.workflow ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.quick{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}</style>
